          ("What if I am already in Bengaluru when the goods are packed in Kolkata?","That is common. A family member or friend can be present at packing to check the inventory, or you can join on a video call while the partner team packs. The signed inventory is shared with you, and you check it against the goods when they reach Bengaluru."),
