          ("Do you pack puja items and idols separately?","Yes. Idols, brass items, conch shells and the puja set are wrapped one by one in soft paper and bubble sheet, packed in a small marked carton and loaded where nothing heavy can press on them. Tell the partner team at the survey which items you want packed this way."),
